# Selecting three tasks and pressing gG wraps them in a new parent that is typed in right away.
file <<END
Trip:
	- Passport
	- Tickets
	- Charger
Home:
	- Water plants
END
keys j J J gG
type Documents
keys <Esc>
see ▌   Documents
quit
saved <<END
Trip:
	Documents
		- Passport
		- Tickets
		- Charger
Home:
	- Water plants
END
